<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Certificado de Campeão - <%= student.name %> | Lab Kids</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@700;900&family=Fredoka:wght@600;700&family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 landscape;
            margin: 0;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
            print-color-adjust: exact !important;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #0f172a;
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .no-print-toolbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            z-index: 99999;
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-action {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-action:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .btn-print {
            background: #10b981;
        }

        .btn-print:hover {
            background: #059669;
        }

        /* Moldura Oficial do Certificado */
        .cert-container {
            width: 297mm;
            height: 210mm;
            background: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            padding: 16mm 18mm;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Bordas Douradas de Gala */
        .cert-outer-border {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 8mm;
            border: 4px solid #b45309;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .cert-inner-border {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 11mm;
            border: 1.5px dashed #d97706;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Brasões nos Cantos */
        .corner-ornament {
            position: absolute;
            width: 32mm;
            height: 32mm;
            border: 3px solid #b45309;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .top-left { top: 8mm; left: 8mm; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
        .top-right { top: 8mm; right: 8mm; border-left: none; border-bottom: none; }
        .bottom-left { bottom: 8mm; left: 8mm; border-right: none; border-top: none; }
        .bottom-right { bottom: 8mm; right: 8mm; border-left: none; border-top: none; }

        .cert-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 4mm;
        }

        .cert-logo {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2mm;
        }

        .cert-title-small {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            color: #b45309;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .cert-title-big {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 2mm 0 0 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .cert-badge-ribbon {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24 0%, #d97706 100%);
            color: #78350f;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 22px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-top: 3mm;
            border: 2px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
        }

        .cert-body {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 3mm 0;
            padding: 0 14mm;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .cert-text-intro {
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            color: #475569;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .cert-student-name {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 3mm 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0 20mm 1mm 20mm;
        }

        .cert-text-description {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #334155;
            margin: 2mm 0;
        }

        .cert-highlight {
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #1e40af;
        }

        .cert-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            padding: 0 16mm 4mm 16mm;
        }

        .sig-block {
            text-align: center;
            width: 70mm;
        }

        .sig-line {
            border-top: 1.5px solid #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 2mm;
        }

        .sig-name {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .sig-role {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cert-seal {
            width: 32mm;
            height: 32mm;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #fde68a 0%, #f59e0b 60%, #b45309 100%);
            border: 3px solid #78350f;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            color: #451a03;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cert-seal-star {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: -2px;
        }

        .cert-seal-text {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: none;
            }
            .no-print-toolbar {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .cert-container {
                box-shadow: none;
                margin: 0;
                width: 100vw;
                height: 100vh;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="no-print-toolbar">
        <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-action btn-print">
            🖨️ Imprimir Certificado Oficial (A4)
        </button>
        <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="btn-action">
            ↩️ Voltar
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="cert-container">
        <!-- Moldura Clássica -->
        <div class="cert-outer-border"></div>
        <div class="cert-inner-border"></div>
        <div class="corner-ornament top-left"></div>
        <div class="corner-ornament top-right"></div>
        <div class="corner-ornament bottom-left"></div>
        <div class="corner-ornament bottom-right"></div>

        <!-- Cabeçalho -->
        <div class="cert-header">
            <div class="cert-logo">🏆 🚀 🌟</div>
            <p class="cert-title-small">Portal Educativo Lab Kids</p>
            <h1 class="cert-title-big">Certificado de Honra ao Mérito</h1>
            <div class="cert-badge-ribbon">
                👑 GRANDE CAMPEÃO • TOP 1 DA SALA
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Corpo do Certificado -->
        <div class="cert-body">
            <p class="cert-text-intro">Certificamos com louvor e orgulho que o(a) dedicado(a) estudante</p>
            
            <div class="cert-student-name">
                <%= student.name %>
            </div>

            <p class="cert-text-description">
                Conquistou o <strong>1º LUGAR (TOP 1)</strong> da turma <span class="cert-highlight"><%= className %></span> 
                na instituição <span class="cert-highlight"><%= schoolName %></span>, acumulando a incrível marca de 
                <span class="cert-highlight" style="color: #b45309; font-size: 1.25rem;"><%= student.points %> XP</span>
                ao longo da <strong><%= season %></strong>, demonstrando excelência, curiosidade, superação e amor pelo conhecimento.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Rodapé e Assinaturas -->
        <div class="cert-footer">
            <div class="sig-block">
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
                <div class="sig-name">Professor(a) / Orientador(a)</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Laboratório de Informática & Sala de Aula</div>
            </div>

            <div class="cert-seal">
                <div class="cert-seal-star">★ ★ ★</div>
                <div class="cert-seal-text">TOP 1<br>OFICIAL</div>
            </div>

            <div class="sig-block">
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
                <div class="sig-name">Direção Pedagógica Lab Kids</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Emitido em <%= date %></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
